message: "If you use this material, please cite it as below. Not peer reviewed. Produced by AI models under the direction of the repository owner (see AI_DISCLOSURE.md)."
title: "Thomson problem, N = 7, logarithmic energy: computational certificates and Lean formalisation"
type: software
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23086382"
authors:
  - name: alejandrozarco
repository-code: "https://github.com/alejandrozarco/thomson-n7-log"
abstract: >-
  Exact certificates, checkers and a Lean 4 formalisation directed at the statement that the regular pentagonal
  bipyramid minimises the logarithmic energy of seven distinct points on the unit sphere, uniquely up to an
  orthogonal map and a relabelling; and the same for the Riesz s = 2 energy. Not peer reviewed.
keywords:
  - Thomson problem
  - logarithmic energy
  - Riesz energy
  - pentagonal bipyramid
  - computer-assisted proof
  - Lean 4
license: Apache-2.0
